Subject: Restore whole original events with native metadata ABI
Upstream-base: 132cdee912111da6c9973b1dce13651f1979b07d

Isolate previous registry/listener/queue/task behavior under an explicit
diagnostic event profile. Genuine source retains original lazy registry
and static initialization, vptr type selection, connection/pool state,
delivery, queued disposal and task reset decisions. Restore the original
platform three-argument template and original callable transfer order.
Only native owner widths, intrusive-node offsets, numeric Wii flag
bitfield ordering and legal mutable callable transfer storage differ.
This compiler/data slice does not qualify original registry execution
or native capture category/stride in the eager function-memory pools.

